<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/7/eng@/~cl_2__list_3__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting, after the definition of \"fact in issue\", the following new definitions; ' \"film\" includes a microfilm and any negative; \"microfilm\" means any transparent material bearing a visual image in reduced size either singly or as a series and includes a microfiche; \"negative\" means a transparent negative photograph on any substance or material, and includes any transparent negative photograph made from the original negative photograph;'."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/7/eng@> .
